{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05902","headline":"济上四贤咏 郑霍二山人 · 王维","name":"济上四贤咏 郑霍二山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩繁华子，多出金张门。\n幸有先人业，早蒙明主恩。\n童年且未学，肉食骛华轩。\n岂乏中林士，无人荐至尊。\n郑公老泉石，霍子安丘樊。\n卖药不二价，着书盈万言。\n息阴无恶木，饮水必清源。\n吾贱不及议，斯人竟谁论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}